1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,150
2036. Tashkent.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:12,660
7 a.m. A flying taxi picks you up in Chilonzor.

3
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:18,980
In the choyxona a robot cooks the plov, but the recipe is still grandma's.

4
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:24,130
At the bazaar you don't ask the price: your glasses show it.

5
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:29,110
At school every child has their own AI tutor.

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:33,610
Doctors find an illness before it even starts.

7
00:00:34,610 --> 00:00:41,630
Science fiction? No. All of this is starting today.

8
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:46,990
Are you ready for 2036?

